-- `#CHECK` over a polymorphic term carries a residual inference variable. The
-- checker names those with a global counter (`a24`, `x13`) — not an identifier
-- in any scope, and different after every edit. The display form is `a`, `b`,
-- … by order of first appearance, the same rendering hover uses.

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH a
ASSUME bottom

#CHECK bottom
#CHECK GIVEN x YIELD x
#CHECK GIVEN x, y YIELD x
#CHECK LIST bottom, bottom
#CHECK GIVEN x YIELD 1 + bottom
